 of the house with timbers . Pu`al Participle מְצֻמֶּה Prov 26:23 impure silver (Toy) laid over ( עַל ) a sherd; plural זָהָב מְצֻמִּים Exod 26:32 , pillars over laid with gold.","rootNote":"a primitive root (probably identical with 6822 through the idea of expansion in outlook, transferring to action);","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 6 15","keyReferences":["1Kgs 6 15","1Kgs 6 15","1Kgs 6 20","1Kgs 6 20","1Kgs 6 21","1Kgs 6 21","1Kgs 6 22","1Kgs 6 22"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":47,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 6 15","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִפָּ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 15","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְצַ֛ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְצַפֵּ֖/הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְצַ֥ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 21","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְצַ֨ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 21","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְצַפֵּ֖/הוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 22","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִפָּ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 22","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צִפָּ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יְצַ֥ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 30","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":30,"englishTe